    <string name="app_name">Lockout Gate</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Lockout Gate uses this service to see which app is in the foreground, so it can block the apps you chose unless a break is active. Only while a hard lock you started is active, it also reads on-screen text in Settings and the app installer to stop Lockout Gate from being turned off or uninstalled until the lock ends. It does not collect, store, or share what is on your screen.</string>

